# Normalize line endings for every contributor and platform.
#
# Every committed blob in this repository is LF, and `scripts/lint.mjs` enforces
# LF in the working tree ("eol" rule). Without this file, a Windows checkout with
# `core.autocrlf=true` writes CRLF into the working tree, so `npm run check`
# fails locally on files nobody touched — while CI (Linux) stays green. Pinning
# `eol=lf` makes the local gate match CI exactly.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the text conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
